<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">CrystalCastleX · CI/CD security</div>
    <h1>Production-oriented security stack</h1>
    <p class="lead">ชุดโครงสร้างสำหรับ Docker, Docker Compose, SBOM, provenance attestation และ GitHub Actions security workflow โดยยึดหลัก <em>least privilege</em>.</p>
    <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Docker</span><span class="tag">GHCR</span><span class="tag">SBOM</span><span class="tag">CodeQL</span><span class="tag">Attestation</span></div>
  </section>

  <section><h2>Architecture</h2><div class="flow"><div class="step"><strong>Validate</strong><br><small>lint · type-check · build</small></div><div class="step"><strong>Artifact</strong><br><small>upload build output</small></div><div class="step"><strong>Docker</strong><br><small>build and publish image</small></div><div class="step"><strong>Scan</strong><br><small>dependency · CodeQL · Trivy</small></div><div class="step"><strong>SBOM</strong><br><small>generate CycloneDX</small></div><div class="step"><strong>Attest</strong><br><small>prove artifact origin</small></div><div class="step"><strong>Verify</strong><br><small>verify immutable digest</small></div></div></section>

  <section><h2>Dockerfile</h2><p>Multi-stage build แยก dependency, build และ runtime พร้อมรันด้วย non-root user.</p><pre><code># syntax=docker/dockerfile:1.7
FROM node:22-alpine AS deps
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci

FROM node:22-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY . .
RUN npm run lint &amp;&amp; npx tsc --noEmit &amp;&amp; npm run build

FROM node:22-alpine AS runner
WORKDIR /app
ENV NODE_ENV=production
RUN addgroup -S appgroup &amp;&amp; adduser -S appuser -G appgroup
COPY --from=builder /app/package*.json ./
COPY --from=builder /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY --from=builder /app/.next ./.next
COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public
USER appuser
EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["npm", "start"]</code></pre></section>

  <section><h2>Docker Compose hardening</h2><pre><code>services:
  app:
    build:
      context: ..
      dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile
    image: ghcr.io/${GITHUB_REPOSITORY:-zyntroai/crystalcastlex}:local
    ports: ["3000:3000"]
    environment: { NODE_ENV: production }
    restart: unless-stopped
    security_opt: [no-new-privileges:true]
    read_only: true
    tmpfs: [/tmp]
    cap_drop: [ALL]
    networks: [crystalcastlex]
  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    command: [redis-server, --appendonly, "yes"]
    security_opt: [no-new-privileges:true]
    cap_drop: [ALL]
    volumes: [redis-data:/data]
    networks: [crystalcastlex]
volumes: { redis-data: {} }
networks: { crystalcastlex: { driver: bridge } }</code></pre></section>

  <section><h2>Software Bill of Materials</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Generate</h3><pre><code>syft dir:. -o cyclonedx-json &gt; sbom.json</code></pre><p>SBOM เป็นรายการ dependencies เพื่อช่วยติดตามความเสี่ยงของ package และ image.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Container image</h3><pre><code>syft ghcr.io/OWNER/IMAGE@sha256:DIGEST \
  -o cyclonedx-json &gt; sbom-container.json</code></pre><p>ใช้ image digest เพื่ออ้างถึง image ที่เปลี่ยนแปลงไม่ได้.</p></article></div></section>

  <section><h2>Security workflow</h2><pre><code>name: Security
on:
  push: { branches: [main] }
  pull_request: { branches: [main] }
  schedule: [{ cron: "30 1 * * 0" }]
  workflow_dispatch:
permissions: { contents: read }
jobs:
  dependency-review:
    if: github.event_name == 'pull_request'
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/dependency-review-action@v4
  codeql:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    permissions: { contents: read, security-events: write, actions: read }
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: github/codeql-action/init@v3
        with: { languages: javascript-typescript }
      - uses: github/codeql-action/autobuild@v3
      - uses: github/codeql-action/analyze@v3
  container-scan:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: docker/build-push-action@v6
        with: { context: ., file: docker/Dockerfile, push: false, tags: crystalcastlex:security }
      - uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master
        with: { image-ref: crystalcastlex:security, format: table, exit-code: "1", ignore-unfixed: true, severity: CRITICAL,HIGH }
  sbom:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    permissions: { contents: read, id-token: write, attestations: write }
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: anchore/sbom-action@v0
        with: { format: cyclonedx-json, output-file: sbom.json, artifact-name: crystalcastlex-sbom }
      - uses: actions/attest@v4
        with: { subject-path: sbom.json }</code></pre></section>

  <section><h2>Permission model</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Validate / test</h3><pre><code>permissions:
  contents: read</code></pre></article><article class="card"><h3>Security scanning</h3><pre><code>permissions:
  contents: read
  security-events: write</code></pre></article><article class="card"><h3>Artifact attestation</h3><pre><code>permissions:
  contents: read
  id-token: write
  attestations: write</code></pre></article><article class="card"><h3>Docker release</h3><pre><code>permissions:
  contents: read
  packages: write
  id-token: write
  attestations: write</code></pre></article></div><div class="note"><strong>Pull requests:</strong> PR โดยเฉพาะจาก fork ควร build และ test ได้ แต่ไม่ควรได้รับสิทธิ์ push GHCR หรือสร้าง registry attestation.</div></section>

  <section><h2>Verification</h2><pre><code># Build artifact
gh attestation verify artifact.tar.gz --repo OWNER/REPOSITORY

# OCI container (use a digest, not a mutable tag)
gh attestation verify \
  oci://ghcr.io/OWNER/IMAGE@sha256:DIGEST \
  --repo OWNER/REPOSITORY</code></pre><p>Digest เป็น immutable identifier จึงเหมาะสำหรับการตรวจสอบ provenance มากกว่า tag เช่น <code>latest</code>.</p></section>
